graph TB
    %% Authentication Flow
    Start([User Access]) --> Auth{Authenticated?}
    Auth -->|No| Login[Login Page]
    Auth -->|No| Register[Register Page]
    Login --> AuthCheck{Valid Credentials?}
    AuthCheck -->|No| Login
    AuthCheck -->|Yes| RoleCheck{User Role?}
    Register --> RegisterForm[Registration Form]
    RegisterForm --> EmailVerify[Email Verification]
    EmailVerify --> Login

    %% Role-Based Routing
    RoleCheck -->|Regular User| UserDash[User Dashboard]
    RoleCheck -->|Admin| AdminDash[Admin Dashboard]
    RoleCheck -->|Super Admin| SuperAdminDash[Super Admin Dashboard]

    %% User Flow - Main Features
    UserDash --> UserSidebar{Select Feature}
    UserSidebar --> Dashboard[Dashboard Overview]
    UserSidebar --> Domains[Domain Management]
    UserSidebar --> Rules[Bot Rules & Control]
